280b795\",\"purpose\":\"development\",\"placement\":\"backlog\",\"title\":\"Persistent planning and review MVP\",\"description\":\"Use the app itself to plan, persist, inspect and review this MVP and subsequent work, while Codex can perform the same CRUD operations through local tools. Deliver the independent-column Tasks board and the nested task graph timeline with a complete contextual CRUD editor/review surface.\\n\\nScope\\n\\n• Deliver and use the two surfaces with durable, shared planning/review data.\\n\\nSuccess criteria\\n\\n1. All three planned review checkpoints pass.\\n\\n2. The real plan is managed in persisted app data rather than in a parallel document.\\n\\n3. A user and Codex can plan, update, inspect and review the same tasks.\\n\\nEvidence\\n\\n• R01, R02 and R03 review records\\n\\n• Final dogfooding walkthrough\\n\\n\",\"importSource\":\"planning-review-mvp\",\"sourceKey\":\"MVP\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-27T07:49:03.291Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-27T07:49:03.292Z\",\"createdBy\":\"agent:codex\",\"views\":[{\"id\":\"node\",\"label\":\"Node\"},{\"id\":\"graph\",\"label\":\"Graph\"}]},{\"id\":\"graph://planning-26535745-4644-4770-af7c-1980c773377b/entries/5307f4a3-f8c1-411a-a2d5-b4493a994fa0.json\",\"kind\":\"evidence\",\"context\":\"99a62c14-535f-4d9a-9ab2-642ed280b795\",\"title\":\"images/V1-revision-2.png\",\"description\":\"Immutable planning source and design evidence\",\"artifact\":{\"name\":\"images/V1-revision-2.png\",\"id\":\"graph://planning-26535745-4644-4770-af7c-1980c773377b/evidence/b4e2f4342c311fc76789735994731052a00df0ecb4b483965d85e487c767e634\",\"hash\":\"b4e2f4342c311fc76789735994731052a00df0ecb4b483965d85e487c767e634\",\"mime\":\"image/png\",\"size\":1361357},\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-27T07:49:03.293Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-27T07:49:03.293Z\",\"createdBy\":\"system:authorized-bootstrap\",\"views\":[{\"id\":\"node\",\"label\":\"Node\"}]},{\"id\":\"graph://planning-26535745-4644-4770-af7c-1980c773377b/entries/5e062ac6-a7c0-4ad3-